Desription:
This game ready 3d model is intended to help you as a content creator by using assets like these to quickly populate 3D game levels or environments with believable assets.Textures are in 2k resolution. Meshes are optimized and subdivision ready. 
Meshes: Tribal_Skull: 2,937 verts, 2,956 faces;
Textures: 
Diffuse;
Roughness;
Normal;
Displacement.
Enjoy making your scenes.

Features:
High level details on the market you can only find;
3D scaned from a real lego, retopology in Blender;
Matches the real lego object.
This model is accurately sized to match the real object. This model was created by the 3d scan with the real lego piece, and i have fixed some holes on the these models, just try to make it not that mess as the way it looks.

Product includes formats :

  - 2014 max;-2017 max;

  - obj;

  - fbx;And  textures 1k, 2k, 4k, 8k res:

  - png;

  - tga;

  - jpg.616 tris only.

About the model
A customized, high-dimensional carpet or wall painting formed based on illustrative vector art that you can use as a household item for interiors.
Features:

  - The Vector art developed in Adobe Illustrator is specifically formed in Substance Painter;

  - To make the model more realistic, dividing the areas intersected by each line of the illustrative vector art into slices, edge details, surface smoothing, and height offset were used in Substance Painter. Besides, the number and size of stitches were applied with particular attention to every detail;

  - Since the displacement map is used in the developed model, the model will not give any freeze to your scenes. We came to this conclusion from our experience with rendering the programs we formatted;

  - Since the model we developed is a design-based interior item, you can use it in different places it suits, such as carpet, wall art or just as a material;

  - When designing drawings on the model, we chose matching colors from the pantone color palette. Therefore, in the texture list you will receive, you can change the base color map using the command Hue / Saturation in Adobe Photoshop (or other alternative program) and adapt it to the colors of your interior;

  - No additional plugin is needed to open the model;

  - Not used Hair&Fur;

  - Threads are made using Opacity map;

  - There are nine texture maps in the texture list: Base color, AO, Metallic, Roughness, Height, Normal, Opacity, Normal_DirectX, Mixed_AO

Hope you like it! Also check out my other models, just click on my user name to see complete gallery.

